nction might be:\n```python\ndef hash_function(key, table_size):\n    return key % table_size\n```\n\nFor string keys, a common approach is to sum the ASCII values of characters:\n```python\ndef string_hash(key, table_size):\n    total = 0\n    for char in key:\n        total += ord(char)\n    return total % table_size\n```\n\nHowever, this simple string hash has poor distribution. Better"
